      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 75,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 174,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Known cycles:\nE1-RC01: E1-R-EMERG -> E1-R-VAULT; broken-by-design-not-tested. RE08/RE09 explicitly show the rejected bootstrap cycle. Select offline independent custody instead; no\nlive proof of cycle removal exists.\nIndependent anchors:\nE1-R-CUSTODY: independent of Hybrid AD/federation/PTA, Normal cloud vault, PIM and ITSM; still depends on Physical custodian availability, Working supported\nmethod/device, Entra and target service. Proof: Authorized R1 retrieval and two fresh sign-ins; not performed.\nE1-R-BASE: independent of Exercised tenant administrator write access, Current live tenant configuration; still depends on Independent custodian and integrity anchor,\nUsable current restore/recreation method. Proof: Retrieve independently held approved baseline and execute R3 object+edge recovery; not performed.\nE1-R-LOGS: independent of Emergency account session, Attacker-writable live configuration; still depends on Regional retained evidence access, Clock/provenance checks.\nProof: Observe independent alert/log retrieval during R1/R3; not performed.",
      "originalText": "Known cycles:\nE1-RC01: E1-R-EMERG -> E1-R-VAULT; broken-by-design-not-tested. RE08/RE09 explicitly show the rejected bootstrap cycle. Select offline independent custody instead; no\nlive proof of cycle removal exists.\nIndependent anchors:\nE1-R-CUSTODY: independent of Hybrid AD/federation/PTA, Normal cloud vault, PIM and ITSM; still depends on Physical custodian availability, Working supported\nmethod/device, Entra and target service. Proof: Authorized R1 retrieval and two fresh sign-ins; not performed.\nE1-R-BASE: independent of Exercised tenant administrator write access, Current live tenant configuration; still depends on Independent custodian and integrity anchor,\nUsable current restore/recreation method. Proof: Retrieve independently held approved baseline and execute R3 object+edge recovery; not performed.\nE1-R-LOGS: independent of Emergency account session, Attacker-writable live configuration; still depends on Regional retained evidence access, Clock/provenance checks.\nProof: Observe independent alert/log retrieval during R1/R3; not performed.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "lineHeight": 2.5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": false
    }
